     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Coverage coverage-amc</b></p><a name=\"coverage-amc\"> </a><a name=\"hccoverage-amc\"> </a><a name=\"coverage-amc-fr-FR\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-coverage-fr.html\">Profil Coverage pour la préadmission FR</a></p></div><blockquote><p><b>com/fhir/StructureDefinition/FrCoverageAMCExtended</b></p><ul><li>nomAMC: Mutuelle Santé Plus</li><li>numeroAMC: 987654321</li><li>codeConvention: 12345</li><li>codeCSR: 67890</li></ul></blockquote><p><b>identifier</b>: <code>http://example.com/identifiers/coverage</code>/AMC-2025-001 (use: official, )</p><p><b>status</b>: Active</p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/coverage-type EHCPOL}\">Assurance Maladie Complémentaire</span></p><p><b>subscriber</b>: <a href=\"Patient-patient-001.html\">Jean Dupont (official) Male, Date de Naissance :1980-01-01 ( http://interopsante.org/fhir/NIR#123456789012345)</a></p><p><b>subscriberId</b>: AMC-987654321</p><p><b>beneficiary</b>: <a href=\"Patient-patient-001.html\">Jean Dupont (official) Male, Date de Naissance :1980-01-01 ( http://interopsante.org/fhir/NIR#123456789012345)</a></p><p><b>period</b>: 2025-01-01 00:00:00+0100 --&gt; 2025-12-31 23:59:59+0100</p><p><b>payor</b>: Assurance Maladie Complémentaire</p></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
